OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies in house fire in Horsham
OL,4,
OL,5,FA man has died in a house fire in a
OL,6,FWest Sussex town, police have said.
OL,8,FEmergency services were called to the
OL,9,Fblaze on Littlehaven Lane, in Horsham,
OL,10,Fat about 07:30 BST.
OL,12,FWest Sussex Fire and Rescue Service
OL,13,Fsent six fire engines, plus an aerial
OL,14,Fladder platform to the scene.
OL,16,FA man was found dead inside the
OL,17,Fproperty, Sussex Police said. His next
OL,18,Fof kin have been informed.
